      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "The use of money for uploading avatars will more than likely lead to lawsuits if you are not the original owner or if you are a game development company who developed an avatar. More than likely the original owner will more than likely desire a cut of the profit and a game studio will take legal steps in people to remove their avatar for public use. This will also inadvertently stifle the desire to upload avatars because of the liabilities. Not to mention this will also add a layer of legal complexity which will more than likely push people away from playing VRChat due to the lack of avatars and use of creativity with already available avatars to be modified, and the potential amount of potential legal intimidation.",
